// Secrets.example.xcconfig
//
// As of the proxy migration, the app no longer needs any API keys — both
// Claude and TMDB are reached through the Vercel proxy
// (https://dearbella-proxy.vercel.app), which holds the keys server-side.
//
// This file is kept only so the build's base configuration reference resolves.
// You can keep an empty "Secrets.xcconfig" alongside it (no values needed).
//
// (The real keys now live in the Vercel project's environment variables, not
// in the app.)
